            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "cdee9dac-d02b-4158-ad12-9ff866ac84bf",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "ae979336-2047-46ca-ac14-4f8900c58c6f",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "859e2197-412b-4ba8-aab4-f8e2dafe931f",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "The listing plan\nshows the service\ndoor south, the\nguest bedroom",
                      "north, and the\nkitchen east. A\nrepair crew can\ncarry tools from\nthe",
                      "south door\nstraight to the\njunction along the\nservice hall. A",
                      "proposed shortcut\ncrosses the\nbedroom. Nib\npoints to the\neasement:",
                      "permission to\nrepair pipes does\nnot grant whatever\nroute is",
                      "shortest. A tenant\nhas asked that\nworkers stop\ntreating her\ncarpet",
                      "as public\ninfrastructure."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "731cef03-ec2d-4719-a4d1-a06f8c03c5f1",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
